Package: bharatpii
Title: Indian Identifier Detection and Privacy Auditing
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Vaisnavi", "Sabarish",
           email = "vaisnavisabarish2@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Adarsh", "S P L",
           email = "adarshds1224@gmail.com",
           role = "aut")
  )
Description: Detects and structurally validates Indian personal
    identifiers in data frames, including Aadhaar (Verhoeff checksum), PAN,
    GSTIN, IFSC, UPI virtual payment addresses, mobile numbers, postal PIN
    codes and Voter ID (EPIC). Supports k-anonymity re-identification risk
    assessment, masking, salted hashing and generalisation of flagged
    columns, and technical audit reports informed by India's Digital
    Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act, 2023. Validity checks do not
    prove that an identifier was ever issued.
